# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxfce4ui
pkgver=4.20.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Xfce's GTK widgets and dialogs"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://xfce.org/"
license=(LGPL-2.0-or-later)
depends=(gtk3 libxfce4util xfconf)
source=("https://archive.xfce.org/src/xfce/libxfce4ui/4.20/libxfce4ui-$pkgver.tar.bz2")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cd libxfce4ui-$pkgver
    # Wayland only, like the rest of Yūrei's GTK
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-debug --disable-introspection --disable-vala --disable-x11 --enable-wayland --disable-startup-notification --disable-glibtop --disable-gladeui2
    make
}

package() {
    cd libxfce4ui-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
